name: Saved run outcomes stay visible with compact notices and the full message route
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/sink_import.py @TMP_TARGET @ART prepare
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
paste-file: @ART/merge-command.txt
keys: Enter
submit: logs
require-live-snap: 25 Saved catalog cannot be merged | failure-recorded
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/sink_import.py @TMP_TARGET @ART failed
paste-file: @ART/failure-replay.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Outcome · failed | failure-receipt
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 20 Outcome · failed | failure-first-frame-40x12
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/compact_reader_notice.py @TMP_TARGET @ART failed
ask: Is the first failed outcome visible with its error badge, dismissal and full-message route at 40x12 without paging or dismissing the notice?
resize: 60x20
live-snap: failure-60x20
resize: 80x24
live-snap: failure-80x24
resize: 96x89
live-snap: failure-96x89
resize: 120x36
live-snap: failure-120x36
resize: 160x48
live-snap: failure-160x48
resize: 120x36
keys: C-g
type: logs
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 LOGS | full-message-route
paste-file: @ART/replace-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Complete import is not claimed | partial-recorded
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/sink_import.py @TMP_TARGET @ART partial
paste-file: @ART/partial-replay.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Outcome · partial | partial-receipt
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 20 Outcome · partial | partial-first-frame-40x12
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/compact_reader_notice.py @TMP_TARGET @ART partial
type: retained-note-42
keys: Left Left Left
require-live-snap: 20 retained-note-42 | retained-draft
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/compact_reader_notice.py @TMP_TARGET @ART before-route
keys: C-g
type: logs
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 retained-note-42 | full-message-draft
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/compact_reader_notice.py @TMP_TARGET @ART after-route
type: X
require-live-snap: 20 retained-noteX-42 | retained-insertion-position
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/compact_reader_notice.py @TMP_TARGET @ART insertion
ask: Does the compact notice keep a usable route through the palette to Logs while preserving the typed draft and its cursor?
keys: End C-u
resize: 120x36
paste-file: @ART/partial-replay.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Outcome · partial | retained-partial
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/partial-replay.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Outcome · partial | recovered-partial
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/sink_import.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does no-color restart preserve both original receipts without repeating work, with larger previews still readable?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
